вно 5² − 3 × (4 + 2)?"}},"options":[{"en":"7","id":"o0","ru":"7"},{"en":"132","id":"o1","ru":"132"},{"en":"19","id":"o2","ru":"19"},{"en":"13","id":"o3","ru":"13"}],"revision":1,"sources":["https://openstax.org/books/prealgebra-2e/pages/2-1-use-the-language-of-algebra"],"type":"single_choice"},{"categoryId":"mathematics","correctOptionId":"o0","difficulty":"easy","id":"mathematics_order_operations_0001","image":null,"localizations":{"en":{"explanation":"Multiplication comes first: 3 × 4 = 12. Then add 2.","question":"What is 2 + 3 × 4?"},"ru":{"explanation":"Сначала выполняют умножение: 3 × 4 = 12. Затем прибавляют 2.","question":"Чему равно 2 + 3 × 4?"}},"options":[{"en":"14","id":"o0","ru":"14"},{"en":"20","id":"o1","ru":"20"},{"en":"24","id":"o2","ru":"24"},{"en":"9","id":"o3","ru":"9"}],"revision":1,"sources":["https://openstax.org/books/prealgebra-2e/pages/2-1-use-the-language-of-algebra"],"type":"single_choice"},{"categoryId":"mathematics","correctOptionId":"o0","difficulty":"medium","id":"mathematics_parentheses_0001","image":null,"localizations":{"en":{"explanation":"Evaluate the parentheses first: 2 + 3 = 5. Then multiply 5 by 4.","question":"What is (2 + 3) × 4?"},"ru":{"explanation":"Сначала вычисляют выражение в скобках: 2 + 3 = 5. Затем 5 умножают на 4.","question":"Чему равно (2 + 3) × 4?"}},"options":[{"en":"20","id":"o0","ru":"20"},{"en":"14","id":"o1","ru":"14"},{"en":"24","id":"o2","ru":"24"},{"en":"12","id":"o3","ru":"12"}],"revision":1,"sources":["https://openstax.org/books/prealgebra-2e/pages/2-1-use-the-language-of-algebra"],"type":"single_choice"},{"categoryId":"mathematics","correctOptionId":"o0","difficulty":"easy","id":"mathematics_product_term_0001","image":null,"localizations":{"en":{"explanation":"Multiplication gives a product; division gives a quotient.","question":"What is the result of multiplication called?"},"ru":{"explanation":"Произведение получают умножением. При делении результат называют частным.","question":"Как называется ре